        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e0f5eed-8cfd-4b85-9593-38df4c7ce490).Image",
        "Description": "47, do you remember the sinking of that tanker two years ago? Terrorist blow a hole in an oil tanker full of crude. It didn&apos;t take long for the government to put an oil fence around the whole mess. And then that massive offshore cleanup facility went up inside. Approximately six hours ago, the structure was seized by an armed group. Their demands are thirty billion dollars. Unless the demands are met, the terrorist intend to blow the facility out of the water. Your mission is to disarm them.",
